{"id":"n24045-1-7","stage":2,"title":"음력 · 阴历","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24045-1-7-1","ko":"너 어제 생일이었어? 내가 알기론 다른 날이었는데.","zh":"你昨天过生日了吗？据我所知是别的日子啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생일이었어?","meaning":"生日，生辰","explanation":"생일：生日，生辰；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"생일","audio":"/audio/a2b4cce280c34b80d474.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63220","senseId":"1","lemma":"생일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알기론","meaning":"以为","explanation":"알다：以为；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"12","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날이었는데.","meaning":"日子","explanation":"날：日子；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62254","senseId":"4","lemma":"날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"a2b4cce280c34b80","term":"생일","zh":"生日，生辰","audio":"/audio/a2b4cce280c34b80d474.mp3","entryId":"63220","definition":"人出生的日子。","pronunciation":["생일"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"以为","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于某个事实，认为或觉得如此。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"818c8a303c20bac0","term":"날","zh":"日子","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3","entryId":"62254","definition":"以某种理由指定下来的一天。","pronunciation":["날"]}],"audio":"/audio/b5a37d96f003fad651c4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24045-1-7-2","ko":"집에서는 음력으로 생일을 지내거든.","zh":"我们在家是按农历来过生日的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집에서는","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"음력으로","meaning":"阴历，农历","explanation":"음력：阴历，农历；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"음력","audio":"/audio/38841c5f87d3d544a2cc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24045","senseId":"1","lemma":"음력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생일을","meaning":"生日，生辰","explanation":"생일：生日，生辰；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"생일","audio":"/audio/a2b4cce280c34b80d474.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63220","senseId":"1","lemma":"생일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지내거든.","meaning":"办，举行","explanation":"지내다：办，举行；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"5","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"38841c5f87d3d544","term":"음력","zh":"阴历，农历","audio":"/audio/38841c5f87d3d544a2cc.mp3","entryId":"24045","definition":"以月亮绕地球一圈所花时间为基准计日的日历。","pronunciation":["음녁"]},{"id":"a2b4cce280c34b80","term":"생일","zh":"生日，生辰","audio":"/audio/a2b4cce280c34b80d474.mp3","entryId":"63220","definition":"人出生的日子。","pronunciation":["생일"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"办，举行","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"进行婚礼或祭祀等活动或仪式。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/15d85cd572b20b4e6478.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.15,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24045","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":67,"sequenceScore":1.7476,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你昨天过生日了吗？据我所知是别的日子啊。","我们在家是按农历来过生日的。","哇，这次游戏是我赢啦！"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你昨天过生日了吗？据我所知是别的日子啊。","我们在家是按农历来过生日的。","哇，这次游戏是我赢啦！"],"answer":1}]}
